    {
      "name": "Motor AS2 (red interna)",
      "description": "Consultas que usa el motor AS2. El gateway no las enruta: se ejecutan directo contra partners-service (host = http://localhost:8081), dentro de la red de contenedores o con el servicio en local.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Alta del socio de prueba",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{host}}/api/partners/complete",
              "host": [
                "{{host}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "partners",
                "complete"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
